    {
      "id": "u_bb107472b58ad35866971d16_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If you don't feel comfortable attaching the logs or anything sensitive to the public GitHub issues, feel free to contact the devs in our Matrix __TRILIUM_PH_0__support channel__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "bb107472b58ad35866971d1641f50ebf4426aee33a3c8e9325a5a3fa598581d9",
      "context": "Error logs > Providing sensitive data",
      "contextHash": "797afda01ec1c2207743f97693856141e658ec10c8d11125fb330f0a22cc25f1",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ログや機密データを公開のGitHubのIssuesに添付することに抵抗がある場合は、Matrixの__TRILIUM_PH_0__サポートチャンネル__TRILIUM_PH_1__で開発者にお気軽にご連絡ください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7f529e1738a40fcbf4a1e906_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Use this email to also provide anything which could assist in analysing the bug - e.g. files/images/ZIPs being imported or __TRILIUM_PH_0__anonymized database__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "7f529e1738a40fcbf4a1e906815944bdd92347fe40299e24986695e0592811eb",
      "context": "Error logs > Providing sensitive data",
      "contextHash": "797afda01ec1c2207743f97693856141e658ec10c8d11125fb330f0a22cc25f1",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "バグの分析に役立つもの（インポートするファイル/画像/ZIP、または__TRILIUM_PH_0__匿名化されたデータベース__TRILIUM_PH_1__など）を提供するためにも、このメールアドレスをご利用ください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
