    },
    {
      "id": "u_2078a506c46a0e373f37de83_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Often times, bugs manifest themselves in specific notes and having them would greatly ease reproduction and fixing.",
      "sourceHash": "2078a506c46a0e373f37de83468036edac10f8c7b8fa2ee246e3de1aafdc4fbb",
      "context": "Error logs > Providing sensitive data > Exporting note subtree for reproduction",
      "contextHash": "92d10def541ebab217d43ada9099c22e003fcba3fb0268b66421c382d0df49c0",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "多くの場合、バグは特定のノートで発生するため、それらのノートがあれば再現と修正が大幅に容易になります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4e550e61aeeb087c6d5774a7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In such case, please export the relevant note subtree by right-clicking it on the left tree, choosing Export - HTML as ZIP:",
      "sourceHash": "4e550e61aeeb087c6d5774a71ab04602c7b5c9b54f4724b02f3c617a469f07bb",
      "context": "Error logs > Providing sensitive data > Exporting note subtree for reproduction",
      "contextHash": "92d10def541ebab217d43ada9099c22e003fcba3fb0268b66421c382d0df49c0",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "そのような場合は、左側のツリーで該当するノートを右クリックし、「エクスポート」から「HTML形式 (ZIP)」を選択して、関連するノートのサブツリーをエクスポートしてください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
